    },
    {
      "text": "Spray a 9x13-inch casserole dish with cooking spray.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Spread ham into the bottom of prepared casserole dish. Butter one side of each bread slice; cut slices into cubes. Arrange buttered bread cubes atop ham; layer American cheese over bread cubes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/i19nvpduqGptzU7k_-Wlj346auk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_229517_ChristmasMorningEggCasserole_Shot3_12142-39e8b2d9e5f64cb0b663b001d04a2879.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229517/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk milk, eggs, mustard powder, and salt together in a bowl; pour over American cheese layer. Cover dish with aluminum foil and refrigerate 8 hours or overnight.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/P4YLcDyrlF0iVaMxAyxz-surtdo=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_229517_ChristmasMorningEggCasserole_Shot5_12153-b324f30302c04c7a845dc7871d6843f4.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229517/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat oven to 350 degrees F (175 degrees C). Remove aluminum foil from casserole.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/-VsiyyE5iHEGghgsBSAsc03CMI8=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/JF_229517_ChristmasMorningEggCasserole_Shot6_12154-97b4e0617b264916a60c110f7643bd65.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/229517/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in the preheated oven until cheese is melted and eggs are set in the middle, about 1 hour.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
